  <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_ypXzf4YmEfG7lISgwFsiWA" name="Airtrick">
    <ownedComment xmi:id="_ypXzgIYmEfG7lISgwFsiWA">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_ypXzgYYmEfG7lISgwFsiWA">
        <body>
Alley oop airs? Is an alley just at style of air? 

Lien airs - air on its own, or frontside air with a nose grab? 

What aboout front melon airs? 

</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_ypXzgoYmEfG7lISgwFsiWA">
        <body>Frigid air - kick out on heel side 

Judo air- kick out on toe side</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <body>Early grab?

Slob? 

Tuck knee

Sal flip?</body>
    </ownedComment>
