      <body>&lt;Enter note text here></body>
    </ownedComment>
    <ownedComment xmi:id="_ypXzqIYmEfG7lISgwFsiWA">
      <body>
Laserflip

Toeflip is a pressure flip

hardflip is a kickflip. Frontside kickflip varial? </body>
    </ownedComment>
    <ownedComment xmi:id="_ypXzqYYmEfG7lISgwFsiWA">
      <body>
&quot;Named&quot; tricks should be a trick execution, not a basic component

Eg Lazer flip, Millerflip, elquerial, caballerial, gazelle flip

Sal flip - nose grab finger flip - Sal Barbier 

Forward flip = Dolphin Flip, Frosty flip, Murder flip

Hospital flip - front foot - half flip varial 

Casper flip - ollie to casper back foot takes i back - casper ollie
</body>
    </ownedComment>
